Pattern	"PAT- 2::GFP or PAT-2::mCherry was found to be expressed in body wall muscles and hypodermal cells during embryogenesis. Notably, a strong GFP signal was observed along the surface of apoptotic cells adjacent to muscle cells, whereas a relatively weak GFP signal was seen around apoptotic cells engulfed by hypodermal cells."
