Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00003929"
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"PAT-2::mCherry and PAT- 3::GFP were co-localized on apoptotic cells and to the dense bodies (Z-disks) and M-lines of muscle cells."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00031335"

Expr_pattern : "Expr10026"
Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0007028" Certain
Antibody
