Pattern	"Animals containing zip-2p::GFP transcriptional fusion showed GFP expression in the pharynx, as well as expression throughout the intestine. Animals transfected with ZIP-2::GFP translational fusion showed virtually no expression when feeding on E. coli, suggesting that while zip-2 mRNA is expressed in uninfected animals, it is not efficiently translated into protein."
Reference	"WBPaper00041034"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00019327"
