Gene	"WBGene00003753"
Pattern	"Reporter construct is expressed primarily or exclusively in neurons or \"endocrine\/secretory\" cells. GFP expression in non-neuronal tissues include the gut (frequently), specific somatic gonad cells, and in pharyngeal or vulval muscles (rarely). No expression is detected in hypodermal, body wall muscle or germ tissues. nlp-15 is expressed in the neurons with cell body on the lateral surface of the body, the head and tail neurons, VNC, pharyngeal neurons and neurons near the vulva."
Reference	"WBPaper00003915"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00003753"
