Subcellular_localization	"TAG-38::GFP is expressed in a highly punctate pattern in axons that largely overlapped with SPHK-1-mCherry or SNN-1-mCherry puncta. TAG-38-GFP localized less well with the synaptic vesicle markers SNB-1 and remained highly punctate in unc-104\/kinesin mutants. This suggests that TAG-38 associates with presynaptic membranes at release sites, but not synaptic vesicles."
