Pattern	"GLB-26 is expressed in the head mesodermal cell, and in the tail in the stomato-intestinal and anal depressor muscle cell. GLB-26 was also found to be expressed in the male anal depressor muscle. The expression pattern observed here is in accordance with the results of a localization study conducted by Hoogewijs and coworkers, who used a transcriptional reporter."
