Subcellular_localization	"As reported previously (Ariz et al., 2009), we observed a perinuclear distribution of PUF-8::GFP that is reminiscent of germ cell-specific P granules. Significantly, we noticed PUF-8::GFP in the nucleus as well, where it was distributed in a diffuse pattern at the inner periphery of thenucleus. In several nuclei, the PUF-8::GFP distribution was asymmetrical, with a crescent-shaped pattern that was strikingly similar to that of TCER-1."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00018131"

