Subcellular_localization	"A functional reporter-tagged OSTA-1 fusion protein expressed in the context of endogenous osta-1 upstream and downstream regulatory sequences localized to the ciliary base region of expressing neurons. Localization to punctate structures was also observed along dendrites and axons and in cell bodies. Although the precise subcellular localization of OSTA-1 awaits higher resolution analyses, these data are consistent with enrichment of OSTA-1 to a region that is proximal to the transition zone and that overlaps with the PCMC."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00018380"

