Remark	"This construct, lacking the slo-2 initiator methionine and upstream promoter, was co-injected together with the F08B12 cosmid containing the entire slo-2 gene and its promoter into the syncitial gonad of adult hermaphrodite N2 nematodes. Recombination between the slo-2:GFP construct and the cosmid was necessary for slo-2:GFP gene expression, and was enhanced by linearization of the slo-2:GFP segment and the cosmid at appropriate sites31. Control injections with the slo-2:GFP segment alone produced no GFP signal."
