Subcellular_localization	"Enrichment of NMY-2::GFP was observed specifically at the membrane surrounding the rachis bridge. NMY-2::GFP was also observed in puncta in the distal germline. Because of the small size of the germ cells, it was not possible to determine if NMY-2::GFP exclusively localized to the membrane or is also present in the cytosol. At the loop region where the germ cells enlarge and undergo oocyte commitment, NMY-2::GFP displayed clear germ cell membrane localization (data not shown)."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00018459"

