Subcellular_localization	"When expressed under an ASK-specific promoter (srbc-66p::tax-4::gfp), TAX-4 was localized to the middle segment, distal to the basal body\/transition fiber region. TAX-4 is localized to the middle segments of ASK cilia, but is present throughout the branches of AWB cilia."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00018853"
Transgene	"WBTransgene00018936"

