In_Situ
In_situ	"Using digoxigenin labeled cDNA yk663g4."
Life_stage	"WBls:0000002"
Pattern	"maternal mRNA was evenly distributed in the early embryo. By about 120min, zygotic mRNA expression began in the progeny of E cell. then progressed into the posterior hypodermal precursor cells. Starting from the comma stage, the mRNA expression localized to the hypodermis and intestine, where it continued during early larva stages. Strong expression in the developing and adult germ line. The mRNA appeared in the primordial gonads of L2-L3 larvae and continued to accumulate in the gonadal loops as they expanded in L4. The adult gonad was loaded with transcript. mRNA expressed declined in the rest of the body after L2."
Reference	"WBPaper00004329"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00003623"

