Subcellular_localization	"Immunofluorescence using affinity-purified rabbit serum that recognized endogenous STA-1 proteins showed STA-1 protein expression throughout the body of Bristol N2 animals and revealed a distinct immunostaining pattern in head ganglia where STA-1 accumulated in the nuclei of a small subset of neurons."

