Pattern	"usp-46 is broadly expressed in a number of tissues, including the nervous system, pharynx, body wall muscle, vulva muscle, and intestine. usp-46 is expressed in many head and ventral cord neurons, and coexpression of a glr-1 transcriptional reporter ( Pglr-1::dsRed ) with Pusp-46::GFP indicated that these include glr-1-expressing neurons."
