Subcellular_localization	"The abundance of GLR-1 was analyzed at synapses by examining the distribution of a green fluorescent protein-tagged version of GLR-1 (GLR-1::GFP), which localizes in a punctate pattern in VNC interneurons. More than 80% of these GLR-1::GFP puncta are closely apposed to presynaptic markers, indicating that the majority of puncta correspond to postsynaptic sites."
