Subcellular_localization	"In growing oocytes, GFP-RAB-5 and mRFP- RAB-7 localized on small cortical puncta; their localization only partially overlapped. After fertilization, the size of the endosomes increased, and GFP-RAB-5 and mRFP-RAB-7 localized on the same enlarged endosomes, although in a mosaic pattern on the membrane."
