Subcellular_localization	"Endogenous LMP-1, detected with a newly developed and specific monoclonal antibody, was targeted to both gut granules and conventional lysosomes in embryos. Endogenous LMP-1 colocalized with CNTS-1::GFP and more basally positioned, PGP-2 containing gut granules. Endogenous LMP-1 was not enriched on the plasma membrane of intestinal cells."

Expr_pattern : "Expr11666"
GO_term	"GO:0005768"
GO_term	"GO:0005797"
GO_term	"GO:0030424"
GO_term	"GO:0031045"
