Gene	"WBGene00003847"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000041"
Pattern	"BLMP-1::GFP showed overlapping expression with DRE-1::GFP in seam and hypodermal cells as well as the dtcs. In the dtcs, BLMP-1::GFP was expressed from mid-L2, when gonadal outgrowth initiates toward head and tail. By mid-L3 (28-30 hr developmental age [DA]), just prior to the dorsal gonadal turn, BLMP-1::GFP levels in the dtcs dropped dramatically. Correlatively, DRE-1::GFP levels in the dtcs increased steadily from L2 to L4. In seam and hypodermal cells BLMP-1::GFP levels were largely constant throughout larval development, except for a transient peak early in L4, which coincides with the time of seam cell fusion, suggesting this BLMP-1 pulse could trigger the fusion event."
Reference	"WBPaper00045017"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00003847"
Remark	"Temporal description"
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00007981"

