Pattern	"the Pvbh-1::GFP::vbh-1::vbh-1 reporter showed high expression in both soma and germline. GFP::VBH-1 expression from line xmSi06 was observed in the cytoplasm of intestinal cells, with a clear enrichment in the apical pole in control animals. Although xmSi06 animals show somatic vbh-1 expression the authors cannot discard that this is an artifact of this transgene."
