Pattern	"During the early L3 stage, lin-17::GFP was expressed predominantly in P11.p and was barely detectable in P10.p. No expression was detected in P9.p. Subsequently, descendants of both P10.p and P11.p expressed lin- 17::GFP, with slightly higher levels in the P11.p descendants."
Reference	"WBPaper00045644"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00003006"
Reporter_gene
