Pattern	"NEKL-2::mCherry was observed in spheres or puncta near the apical surface of the hypodermis including the hyp7 syncytium. Similar to NEKL-3::GFP, NEKL-2::mCherry was not observed in the seam cells. In contrast to NEKL-3::GFP, NEKL-2::mCherry was not observed in the vulva. Of particular interest, NEKL-3::GFP puncta only rarely co-localized with NEKL-2::mCherry in hyp7, suggesting that these kinases may function in distinct cellular compartments."
Reference	"WBPaper00046177"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00022631"
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00031730"

