Pattern	"ina-1 is expressed throughout uterine toroids. At mid L4, expression is seen in uterine toroid 1 and 4 (ut1, ut4) and in the anterior uterine toroids 2 and 3 (ut2, ut3). In addition, ina-1::GFP is detected in the spermathecal-uterine junction and spermatheca. At the L4 lethargus stage, bright expression is observed in uterine toroids 1 and 4, the spermathecal-uterine junction, and spermatheca. Dimmer expression is present in uterine toroid 2 and posterior toroid 3. Fluorescence is also detected in vulE."
Reference	"WBPaper00050256"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00002081"
Remark	"To cite this work: Ghosh, Srimoyee; Inoue, Takao; Sternberg, Paul (2015): ina-1::gfp expression. WormBase. Dataset. DOI: http:\/\/dx.doi.org\/10.17912\/W2159J . Reviewed by Bhagwati Gupta. Funding: National Institutes of Health USPHS training grant GM07616."
