Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"EFF-1 localization in C. elegans embryonic epidermal cells is tightly maintained in early endosomes by the RAB-5- and DYN-1-dependent endocytic machinery. The EFF-1 protein is dynamically delivered to all apical plasma membranes transiently and without specificity to the place of fusion."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00022934"

