Gene	"WBGene00019953"
Reference	"WBPaper00049196"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00019953"
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"GFP::WAPL-1 protein is present, with a diffuse staining pattern, in both mitotic and meiotic nuclei. Interestingly, the intensity of the GFP::WAPL-1 signal decreased drastically as transition zone nuclei acquired the chromosome clustering characteristic of early meiotic prophase stages (leptotene and zygotene), peaking again at late pachytene and then remaining at similar high levels in diplotene and diakinesis oocytes."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00031930"

