Pattern	"GFP expression appeared in the seam cells at the very beginning of the L4 stage and continued on through adulthood. GFP was never seen in the seam cells before the L3-to-L4 transition in a wild-type background (100%, n 80 animals). Seam cell expression of let-7::gfp is significant as let-7 is normally required for seam cell development. Nontemporally regulated GFP expression was observed in other parts of the worm, including the pharynx, intestinal cells, muscle cells, and neurons."
