Pattern	"TSP-15::GFP expression begins in the middle of embryogenesis (around the comma stage) and continues through adulthood. Expression was detected in the pharynx and body wall from the larva to the adult and in the vulva at the adult stage. In transverse sections, TSP-15::GFP appears to be present in hyp7, including the thin regions between the cuticle and the body muscle quadrants. In addition, TSP-15::GFP is expressed in a punctate pattern in the thick region of the hypodermis."
