Pattern	"Immunocytochemistry using affinity-purified antibodies on fixed C. elegans embryos of varying ages revealed that AIR-1 is present on mitotic centrosomes. In the adult, AIR-1 staining was also found on the centrosomes of mitotic germ cells in the distal gonad."
