Pattern	"RSD-3::GFP fusion protein was expressed in all somatic tissues including the pharynx, neurons, excretory canal, coelomocytes, intestine, body-wall muscles, hypodermis and seam cells. The RSD-3::GFP fusion protein was diffusely distributed in the cytoplasm and also localized in a punctate pattern in most tissues, indicating that RSD-3 associates with some organelles or vesicles (see Expr12959). Expression of RSD-3 was previously reported to be high in the coelomocytes, but in our observation, the expression level of RSD-3::GFP in coelomocytes was comparable with those in other tissues."
