Pattern	"Similar to myosin, ECT-2 is expressed in neuroblasts and epidermal cells and localizes to the junction-free edges of the lateral epidermal cells around the ventral pocket during ventral enclosure. However, unlike myosin, ECT-2 is more uniformly distributed around the cell boundaries."
