Pattern	"SCAV-3::GFP is widely expressed during embryonic, larval, and adult stages in various tissues including pharynx, hypodermis, gonadal sheath cells, vulva, and tail region. SCAV-3::GFP was not evident in the intestine and was only very weakly expressed in body wall muscle cells."
