Pattern	"HLH-3::GFP was expressed in the I4 neuron shortly after its mother divided to generate I4; by contrast, the I4 sister, pm5, did not express this protein. Expression of HLH-3::GFP was also observed in multiple AB-derived neural precursors. The broad expression of HLH-3::GFP was mostly confined to embryos and was no longer detectable in the I4 neuron in newly hatched L1s, suggesting that hlh-3 functions primarily in early embryos to promote I4 specification."
