Subcellular_localization	"There was no GFP fluorescence in the muscles of animals with the myo-3::pnc-1a transgenes, as expected after efficient secretion. Upon expression at a higher level, PNC-1a::GFP visibly accumulated in the body cavity and within the coelomocytes. We conclude that PNC-1a is a secreted isoform."
