Pattern	"PDK-1\/GFP expression is observed in late stage embryos and throughout the life of the animal. In postembryonic animals, PDK-1\/GFP expression is observed in the cell bodies and processes of the majority of neurons in the head and tail, in the motor neurons of the ventral nerve cord and neuronal processes along the body of the animal, in the cells and neurons of the pharynx, in intestinal cells, and in hypodermal cells. In L4s and adults, PDK-1\/GFP is also expressed in the somatic gonad."
Reference	"WBPaper00003568"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00003965"
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"cell bodies and processes of neurons"
