Pattern	"Expression of the established daf-7 promoter-GFP transcriptional reporter ksIs2 was detected in multiple developing neurons in comma-stage embryos, as well as in several neurons in 3-fold embryos. Importantly, accumulation of secreted mCherry::DAF-7 protein was detected in the extraembryonic fluid at the same embryonic stages as the SMAD::GFP fluorescence, suggesting that DAF-7 activity may have a physiological role in the early embryos. We also detected pharyngeal expression and localization to coelomocytes in 3-fold embryos."
