Pattern	"GFP expression driven by the gop-1 promoter (Pgop-1GFP) was observed from embryonic stages throughout larval and adult stages in several engulfing cell types such as pharyngeal muscle cells, intestine cells, and gonadal sheath cells. GFP expression was also seen in coelomocytes and dorsal and ventral nerve cord, consistent with the function of GOP-1 in endosome and DCV maturation."
