Pattern	"As with the N-terminally tagged F28F8.5 [Expr13396], F28F8.5::GFP showed both nuclear and cytoplasmic localization. As expected for an extrachromosomal transgene, the expression of F28F8.5::gfp was not detected in the germline. This reporter was expressed in embryos starting at the twofold stage and continued throughout development. We did notice that F28F8.5::gfp was expressed in the excretory canal cell, a pattern not observed with the endogenously edited GFP-tagged gene."
Reference	"WBPaper00051354"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00009223"
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00032112"

