Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"DLC-1 showed a broad diffuse distribution across the germline, overlapping with DHC-1, but without detectable enrichment at the sites of DHC-1 accumulation. FLAG::DLC-1 is present within P granules in both the mitotic region and the transition zone. DLC-1 was not particularly enriched in P granules compared with overall cytoplasmic background. Additionally, we observed foci of DLC-1 that did not coincide with either P granules or DHC-1 patches. As DLC-1 overlaps with both P granules and DHC-1 patches, we conclude that DLC-1 might support function of both protein complexes."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00023670"

