Life_stage	"WBls:0000041"
Pattern	"The product of coh-1 was detected by immunocytology in somatic and embryonic nuclei but was not found to be localized to the condensed chromosomes of cells in mitosis. Within the gonad, the strongest immunostaining of COH-1 was found in the nucleus of the distal tip cell. COH-1 was strikingly absent from the mitotic and the transition zone of the gonads but reappeared on pachytene and diplotene\/diakinesis chromosomes."
Reference	"WBPaper00004722"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00000591"
Subcellular_localization	"nuclei"

