Life_stage	"WBls:0000003"
Pattern	"This purely embryonic pattern first expresses at the approximately 200 cell stage. Expression is seen variously as either a single nucleus, or as a set of 2,4 or 6 nuclei. At the comma stage strongly expressing dorsal nuclei are observed. This gene has homology to RAS-related GTP binding proteins."
Reference	"WBPaper00002318"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00019317"
Remark	"Other strain-- UL590. Legacy Data: Author \"Mounsey A\" \"Bauer PK\" \"McCarroll D\" \"Hope IA\" Date 1999-11."
