Pattern	"Worms expressing the Pswip-13::GFP transgene revealed GFP expression in a number of head neurons and in a pair of neurons resembling PDE, as well as expression by a small number tail neurons and by developing oocytes. Dual labeling studies with animals expressing a dopaminergic mCherry reporter (Pdat-1:: mCherry) revealed colabeling in all DA neurons (CEP, ADE, PDE)."
Reference	"WBPaper00052965"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00015478"
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00024977"

