Pattern	"ptol-1::GFP gave expression in late gastrula embryos in a number of unidentified anterior ventral cells and several dorsal epithelial cells. Expression in the ALM neurones was observed during axonal elongation in late embryos. There was a progressive restriction in the expression domains of the two reporters, such that in adults. pStol-1::GFP gave expression in the 4 URY neurones, and six interneurones (ALNL\/R, AVDL\/R, and two neurones in the retrovesicular ganglion that remain to be identified). Expression was also seen in the head mesodermal cell."
Reference	"WBPaper00004692"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00006593"
Remark	"Original paper indicated that expression was also seen in the six mechanoreceptor cells (ALML\/R, AVM, PLML\/R, and PVM). However, according to author's email to WormBase on 05\/09\/2009, the expression was due to contaminant DNA from a pmec promotor. --wjc."
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00027478"

