Subcellular_localization	"Functional MIG-14::mCherry fusion protein expressed from the PVD-specific ser-2.3 promoter showed punctate signals in both the PVD soma and the dendrites. In the soma, MIG-14 was localized at the cell membrane and in intracellular compartments, such as the endoplasmic reticulum (ER), the Golgi, and the early and recycling endosomes, but not mitochondria or lysosomes. In the tertiary dendrites, two forms of MIG-14 signals were observed: punctate signals that largely colocalized with the early endosome marker RAB-5 and diffuse signals that highlighted the dendrite shapes."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00025251"

