Pattern	"Consistent with previous findings, Pcwn-2::GFP is expressed beginning in early embryonic stages, mainly in the digestive and nervous systems, with weak expression in the body wall muscles at adult stage. The GFP reporter is only seen in the intestine before 2-fold stage. In late embryonic stage, Pcwn-2::GFP is expressed both in the intestine and the pharynx. After hatching, Pcwn-2::GFP is mainly seen in the pharynx, some head neurons, the body wall muscle and the intestine. However, Pcwn-2::GFP is not seen in the AIY."
