Life_stage	"WBls:0000041" Anatomy_term "WBbt:0006796"
Not_in_Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0006797"
Pattern	"To examine endogenous OEF-1 expression, we generated a polyclonal antibody to OEF-1. The endogenous antibody recapitulates the expression pattern of the OEF- 1:GFP transgene in larval stage 4 (L4) and adult dissected gonads. In embryos, endogenous OEF-1 protein expression is first visible even earlier than OEF-1:GFP, in the P2 blastomere rather than P4. However, OEF-1 protein expression is not detectable in maturing oocytes, implying that little to no OEF-1 is maternally loaded."
Reference	"WBPaper00053382"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00018636"

