Pattern	"Using a fosmid-based GFP translational fusion, we found that zag-1 was expressed in the six TRNs but not in the FLP and PVD neurons. In addition to TRNs, zag-1 was expressed in the AIB, AIM, AIN, AIZ, AVA, AVB, AVD, AVE, AVG, AVK, AVL, M4, M5, RIA, RIB, RIF, RIG, RIM, RIV, RMD, RME, RMF, RMH, SIA, and SMD neurons in the head, all the DD, VD, and VC neurons in the ventral cord, and the DVA, DVB, LUA, PDA, PVC, PVP, PVQ, PVR, and PVT neurons in the tail. zag-1 is also expressed in the serotonergic HSN neurons."
Reference	"WBPaper00055360"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00006970"
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00017469"

