Pattern	"In males, Pddo-3::mCherry was expressed in the excretory pore cell, head tip cells, and hypodermal cells, in a pattern similar to that observed in hermaphrodites. Moreover, this reporter protein was expressed in seminal vesicle cells from L4 and in tail cells and spicule cells from the adult stage."
Reference	"WBPaper00055548"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00017648"
