Remark	"C06G8.2 = CPTA(cDNA) in this article."
Remark	"Throughout the animal life span, the overall expression level of CPTB was consistently higher than that of CPTA. At the embryo stage, the CPTBCPTA ratio was estimated to be ~11, and this value decreased to ~ 2 at the mixed stage. See Expr1421 for CPTB expression."

