Pattern	"We inserted an in-frame gfp cassette into the endogenous tmc-1 locus using the CRISPR\/Cas9 knockin method (Li et al., 2015). Using this approach, we observed TMC-1 expression in vulval muscles as well as several head neurons and body wall muscles."
Reference	"WBPaper00053659"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00020490"
