Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"As the GFP signal is relatively weak in our single copy GFP insertion tmc-1::GFP line, we performed GFP staining to investigate the subcellular localization of TMC-1 protein. Our staining results suggested that a large portion of TMC-1 proteins might be expressed on the plasma membrane."

