Gene	"WBGene00019726"
Reference	"WBPaper00053879"
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"mCherry-BRIS-1 predominantly labeled the basolateral tubular and punctate endosomes."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00026081"

