Reference	"WBPaper00056596"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00007640"
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"Besides embryos, pcmd-1(syb486 [gfp::pcmd-1]) localized to centrioles in all tissues analyzed, including the germline, sperm, and at basal bodies of sensory cilia. We also analyzed whether PCMD-1 localizes to the PCM matrix by co-staining with SPD-5. In pro-metaphase blastomeres, GFP::PCMD-1 localizes to the centrioles and expanded into the PCM, where it co-localized with filamentous structures of SPD-5. In summary, GFP::PCMD-1 predominantly localizes to centrioles with only a small fraction of the protein being part of the pericentriolar material matrix in early mitosis."
Subcellular_localization	"Besides embryos, pcmd-1(syb486 [gfp::pcmd-1]) localized to centrioles in all tissues analyzed, including the germline, sperm, and at basal bodies of sensory cilia. We also analyzed whether PCMD-1 localizes to the PCM matrix by co-staining with SPD-5. In pro-metaphase blastomeres, GFP::PCMD-1 localizes to the centrioles and expanded into the pericentriolar material, where it co-localized with filamentous structures of SPD-5. In summary, GFP::PCMD-1 predominantly localizes to centrioles with only a small fraction of the protein being part of the pericentriolar material matrix in early mitosis."
Variation	"WBVar02150025"

