Pattern	"Using the translational reporter line expressing GFP-tagged MINA-1 opIs408, we found that mina-1::gfp was expressed only in the transition and pachytene zones, suggesting that mina-1 mRNA might be post-transcriptionally repressed within the mitotic and late meiotic zones. Subcellularly, MINA-1 was localized mainly to perinuclear foci, which were adjacent to germline P granules."
Reference	"WBPaper00056165"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00008061"
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00025843"

