Pattern	"Animals containing the unc-47::GFP reporter construct showed expression of GFP in all GABAergic neurons, and only in GABAergic neurons."
Reference	"WBPaper00002911"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00006783"
Remark	"Suncellular localization was revealed by another construct with GFP inserted at the carboxy terminus of the UNC-47 protein. This construct rescued the unc-47 mutant phenotype, demonstrating that the construct functions normally."
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"Done by another gfp construct: GFP-tagged UNC-47 was localized to synaptic varicosities along the ventral and dorsal cords but not in axons. show that unc-47 expression is associated with synaptic vesicle."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00027526"

