Pattern	"Native GFP::CATP-7 is expressed closely associated with the plasma membrane of the amphid sensory neurons (localized to the sensilla), the gonadal sheath cells, the spermatheca, the hypodermis and the excretory cel. GFP::CATP-7 is expressed in most pharyngeal cells, where it localizes to the plasma membrane, plus internal membranous tubules. GFP::CATP- 7 is also expressed in the intestine, where it is associated with tubular structures in the basolateral domain and with vesicles in the apical domain immediately below the microvilli. GFP::CATP-7 is strongly expressed in spermatocytes and spermatids."
