Pattern	"Expression of fluorescent reporter constructs for mip-1 localized to the ventral and dorsal nerve cords, along with several ventral cord motor neurons. Additionally, we observed mip-1 expression in around 8 neurons in the head and 3 neurons in the tail. Based on position and unique morphology of their projections, we identified the SAB and DB1 motor neurons in the head, which are involved in forward locomotion."
Reference	"WBPaper00056242"
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00032323"

