Reference	"WBPaper00050595"
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"TGN-38 expressed in coelomocytes most prominently labeled Golgi punctae, and, to a lesser extent, endosomes, similar to what has been reported in the worm intestine and in other organisms."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00023806"

