Subcellular_localization	"A translational reporter with GFP fused to the C terminus of TMEM-131 driven by the endogenous tmem-131 promoter reveals an intracellular perinuclear reticulum pattern. In addition, SignalP-4.1 predicts an ER signal peptide sequence (amino acids 1 to 30) of TMEM-131, supporting its ER endosomal localization. To confirm the prediction, we generated an mCherry-tagged ER reporter driven by the tmem-131 promoter, with ER signal peptide at the N terminus and KDEL ER retention sequence at the C terminus. We found that TMEM131::GFP colocalized to the ER sig::mCherry::KDEL signal."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00027022"
Transgene	"WBTransgene00027024"

