Subcellular_localization	"For ODR-10::GFP (AWB), ODR-10::dsRed (PHA\/B), UNC-101::GFP (PHA\/B), GFP::RAB-8 (PHA\/B) and RAB-8::dsRed (AWB), punctate perinuclear signals were observed, which is consistent with early sorting of ODR-10 by AP-1 or RAB-8 in the cell soma. In addition, ODR-10 and RAB-8 (N- and C-terminal tagged) localised to AWB and PHA\/B cilia; however, no specific UNC-101::GFP signals were found at ciliary structures, and in dendrites, signals were mostly diffuse, with only a few visible (and faint) punctuate spots, suggesting that UNC-101 functions mostly in the cell soma."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00027063"

