Pattern	"In hermaphrodites, ENRI-3::GFP was detected in the maturing germline of L4 larvae, with its expression peaking during spermatogenesis and in mature sperm in young adult hermaphrodites. ENRI-3 localization was concentrated in distinctive perinuclear puncta around germline nuclei, and co-localizes with the P granule marker PGL-3. The strongest expression of ENRI-3 was detected in the germline cytoplasm of male animals. ENRI-3 could also be detected in embryos and early larval stages, but its expression was limited to the precursor cells of the germline (Z2 and Z3)."
