Pattern	"Worms expressing a fosmid-recombineered GFP transgene for npr-11 showed fluorescence in several head and tail neurons. This transgene confirmed the previously reported expression of npr-11 in AIA interneurons (Chalasani et al., 2010). In addition, we observed npr-11 expression in ASK and ADL sensory neurons, validated by DiI staining of amphid neurons, as well as in several unidentified cells in the head. In the tail, the npr-11 reporter transgene was expressed in PVQ and most likely in DVA or DVC neurons."
Reference	"WBPaper00059878"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00016110"
