Pattern	"Pmctp-1b::GFP was expressed throughout the nervous system in 100% of analyzed worms. To determine whether Pmctp-1b::GFP was expressed only in neurons and not neuronal support cells, we co-expressed it with a pan-neuronal reporter Prab-3::mCherry. We found that Pmctp-1b::GFP is expressed in neurons which include the motor neurons in the ventral nerve cord and ciliated neurons in the hermaphrodite head."
Reference	"WBPaper00059962"
