Life_stage	"WBls:0000002"
Northern
Pattern	"There are four transcripts. The most abundant 0.75 kb transcript was expressed at constant level throughout development. A transcript of 1.3 kb was highly enriched in embryos. This transcript is also more abundant in adults, although not sure if it is because of the eggs in adult uterus. The relatively rare transcripts of 2.1 kb and 4.4 kb expression varied little throughout development."
Reference	"WBPaper00001921"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00000423"

