Pattern	"In adult C. elegans, nhr-66 is broadly expressed, including hypodermis, gut, muscle, and neuronal cells of the ventral nerve chord, head, and tail ganglia. In the head ganglion, several sensory and interneurons, including AVA, express NHR-66. Interestingly, global nhr-66 expression was not altered with age."
