Pattern	"We reassessed the expression pattern of APL-1 using a fosmid from the TransgeneOme project in which a genomic copy of APL-1 was tagged with GFP. Overall the expression pattern was similar to those previously described with APL-1 expression detectable in head muscle cells, head neurons as well as the nerve chords. However, an important difference was that APL-1::GFP expression was also detected in the intestine."
Reference	"WBPaper00046969"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00000149"
