Subcellular_localization	"By immuno-electron microscopy, DYS-1-GFP was detected with a monoclonal GFP antibody conjugated to gold-beads. Gold-beads were observed at the inner layer of the sarcolemma all around the muscle cell: (1) at the basal membrane where sarcomeric bundles anchor, (2) at the membrane facing the adjacent muscle cells and (3) at the membrane facing the intestinal cell. Along the basal membrane, DYS-1::GFP was rarely observed at A bands and M lines (MLs) but rather enriched at dense bodies proximity."

