Pattern	"In Pnuc-1::NLS::GFP transgenic embryos, GFP was observed exclusively in the head region of comma and 1.5-fold stage embryos. In 3-fold or 4-fold embryos, in addition to the head region, GFP was also observed in anterior intestinal cells. In Pnuc-14xNLS::GFP transgenic larvae and adults, GFP was strongly expressed in anterior and posterior intestinal cells, and occasionally, in all intestinal cells. Weak GFP expression was also detected in the vulva, head and body wall muscle cells."
