Subcellular_localization	"Like TSP-14, intracellular TSP-12 is also localized to early endosomes, late endosomes, and recycling endosomes, is in close juxtaposition with the retromer VPS-35, and is absent in the ER. Unlike TSP-14, GFP::3xFLAG::TSP-12 exhibits some, but not extensive, colocalization with the late Golgi marker TagRFP::SYN-16."
Variation	"WBVar02147524"
Variation	"WBVar02157768"
Variation	"WBVar02157769"

