Subcellular_localization	"Notably, in hypodermal cells, ATG-9::GFP puncta colocalized with structures containing the seipin ortholog SEIP-1 endogenously tagged with mScarlet (SEIP-1::mScarlet). As seipin\/SEIP-1 localizes to ER-LD contact sites, this finding is consistent with the tight association of ATG9 structures with the ER and LDs observed in cultured human cells."
