Pattern	"FLP-18::Venus fluorescence was observed in the RIM and AVA escape circuit neurons, as well as the AIY and RIG. FLP-18::Venus fluorescence was also observed in the coelomocytes, in contrast to a Pflp-18::GFP transcriptional reporter which did not produce detectable coelomocyte fluorescence. This is consistent with the idea that FLP-18::Venus protein is secreted and taken up by coelomocytes, which are endocytic scavenger cells that internalize material from the pseudocoelomic fluid."
