Subcellular_localization	"We analyzed the localization patterns of GSP-1 and GSP-2 in wild-type animals. We found that GSP-1 and GSP-2 protein expression is enriched in -1 oocytes at diakinesis. GSP-1::GFP and GSP- 2::GFP exhibited similar cup-like localizations around the bivalents in 63% (19\/30) and 69.5% (16\/23), respectively, of -1 oocytes, whereas in the remaining 37% (11\/30) and 30.5% (7\/23) of -1 oocytes, weak and diffuse signals (not on the chromosomes) were observed inside the nuclei."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00033558"

