Subcellular_localization	"The pdi-6::gfp signal is co-localized with the ER luminal marker vha-6p::SEL-1(1-79)::mCherry::HDEL in the intestine. We did not observe co-localization of pdi-6::gfp with the mitochondrial outer membrane marker ges-1p::tomm-20::mKate2::HA (Ahier et al., 2018). Additionally, we found no obvious co-localization of pdi-6::gfp with a lysosomal membrane marker ced1p::laat-1::mCherry (Miao et al., 2020)."

