Pattern	"We visualized mNG::LEA-1 fluorescence in dauer larvae. We found that the protein was prominently expressed in specific tissues: the germline, body wall muscle, pharynx, and excretory cell. mNG::LEA-1 was localized to both the excretory cell body, which is adjacent to the pharynx, as well as excretory canals, which extend laterally along the length of the body. Some faint expression was seen in seam cells (lateral hypodermal cells) , as well as the intestine. Additionally, some unidentified cells in the head were fluorescent."
Reference	"WBPaper00062379"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00002263"
