Pattern	"We found that DAF-16::GFP was expressed ubiquitously in most or all somatic tissues, such as neurons, intestine, BWM, and hypodermis, and also in the germ cells and oocytes. Germline expression of DAF-16::GFP was not detected by earlier transgene reporters.Temporally, ubiquitous expression of DAF-16::GFP from the endogenous locus was detected from the embryonic bean stage to adulthood."
Reference	"WBPaper00064632"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00000912"
