Pattern	"ZYX-1 (cp415 ) is expressed in dorsal and ventral epidermal cells. Strikingly, ZYX-1 showed a pattern complementary to that of TES-1 (Expr16430): whereas mNG::TES-1 showed strong expression in seam cells, ZYX-1 was expressed strongly within nonseam cells. mNG::ZYX-1 is recruited to both dorsal-seam and seam-ventral junctions, and it also co-localizes with circumferential filament bundles (CFBs)."
Reference	"WBPaper00064685"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00006999"
