Gene	"WBGene00000443"
Pattern	"Quantifying the cellular fluorescence intensity up to the 350-cell stage, we found that, while the mNG was present in most embryonic cells for the transcriptional reporter, it was absent in 65% of the cells in the translational reporter strains. This suggests that the CEH-20 protein-coding sequence selectively restricts the otherwise ubiquitous mNG expression to specific cells. The single-cell fluorescent expression data of ceh-20 transcriptional and translational reporters is shown in Table S4(sheet d) of the paper."
Reference	"WBPaper00066565"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00000443"
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00033878"

