Remark	"The amount of hsp70F in the transgenic line carrying pPD70f increased two- to three-fold relative to the wild-type animals. The expression pattern of hsp70F in transgenic lines carrying pPD70f were almost the same as that of the expression of GFP in transgenic line carrying pPD91.14."
Remark	"hsp70F = hsp-6 --[cgc1136]."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00000301"

