Life_stage	"WBls:0000041"
Pattern	"del-1 is expressed in the VB motor neurons beginning in the L2 larval stage. By the end of L2, del-1::GFP is also visible in a few VA motor neurons at the anterior end of the nerve cord. Expression of del-1::GFP in the VAs progresses in a wave from anterior to posterior, with all VAs expressing del-1::GFP by the adult stage. Thus, del-1::GFP is not expressed in the VAs during the L2 period in which unc-4 functions in these cells to establish synaptic inputs but is expressed in the VAs after they have been wired into the ventral cord circuit. del-1::GFP is also expressed in five neurons (VB1, VB2, SABVR, SABVL, VA1) in the retrovesicular ganglion at the anterior end of the ventral nerve cord. During the mid-L2 larval stage, del-1::GFP expression in the ventral nerve cord is largely restricted to the VB class of motor neurons."
Reference	"WBPaper00003757"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00000952"
Remark	"Reporter gene fusion type not specified."
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00005034"

