Pattern	"This fusion gene was ubiquitously expressed, with prominent expression in body-wall muscle and neurons. A GFP fusion to the full length lrs-2 gene, lrs-2::GFP, containing the same upstream sequences and the entire lrs-2 open reading frame (ORF), rescued the longevity phenotype of lrs-2(mg312) and had similar expression and localization patterns."
