Antibody	"Polyconal rabbit antibody. A 510-bp (Met-1 to Val-170 of VHA-5) cDNA fragment was inserted into pGEX6P-2(Amersham Pharmacia Biotech). The recombinant proteins expressed in Escherichia coli were used to immunize rabbits, and the antisera were affinity-purified using the same recombinant protein."
