Gene	"WBGene00000802"
Reference	"WBPaper00004858"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00000802"
Subcellular_localization	"In intestinal cells, clustered signals of CRT-1 were observed around the intestinal vacuoles and intestinal granules of wild-type worms. The intestinal cells of C. elegans are characterized by the appearance of such granules and vacuoles alongside the intestinal lumen. In body-wall muscles, distinct enclosed signals of CRT-1 in the cytoplasmic regions of the muscle cells were observed. In the pharyngeal muscle cells, signals were detected in the cytoplasmic regions between muscular structures."

