GO_term	"GO:0005737"
Gene	"WBGene00000199"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000003"
Pattern	"ARX-1 was localized in the cytoplasm of all of the cells. ARX-1 was localized among a broad range of cells including the hypodermal cells."
Reference	"WBPaper00005843"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00000199"
Remark	"A reduction in the fluorescent intensities in embryos treated for arx-1(RNAi) confirmed the specificity of the staining against ARX-1. In arx-1(RNAi) embryos, no obvious changes in actin localization was observed by using an anti-actin antibody, although there was defect in actin filament formation."
Subcellular_localization	"cytoplasm"

