GO_term	"GO:0005921"
Gene	"WBGene00002125"
Reference	"WBPaper00005835"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00002125"
Subcellular_localization	"Labeling with gold particles of large gap junctions was detected in the pharynxes of adult animals. No labeling of gap junctions was detected in other tissues, such as intestine and hypodermis, or of other well-preserved junction types, such as adherens junctions. Although similar large gap junctions are present in the anterior pharynx, only gap junctions in the posterior pharynx, where inx-3 is expressed, were detected by immuno-EM."

