Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0005733" Certain
Antibody	"Mouse monoclonal antibody against DPY-7. Recombinant DPY-7 protein fragments were generated in Escherichia coli by using the QIAGEN vector pQE-30, according to standard manufacturer's protocol. A DPY-7 fragment constituting most of the predicted mature protein was used to immunize mice, and monoclonal cell lines were generated by fusing splenocytes to Sp2\/O-Ag14 myeloma cells by using standard methods. The cell line DPY7-5a was selected for use based on the sensitivity and specificity of the antibody for the DPY-7 protein. It reacts to an epitope within the 40 carboxy-terminal non-Gly-X-Y residues of the protein."
Antibody
