Antibody	"Polyclonal peptide rabbit antibody. CSC-1specific antisera were produced in rabbits using a COOH-terminal peptide (CGPLQPETENAGTSV) coupled to keyhole limpet hemocyanin. An antibody raised against an NH2-terminal peptide provided essentially identical results in immunofluorescence and immunoprecipitation assays. Antibodies were affinity purified using immobilized peptides."
Antibody
