Expr_pattern : "Expr2564"
Antibody	"Mouse monoclonal antibody against LIN-5, anti-LIN-5 hel-1, was used for immunostaining."
Antibody	"Polyclonal rabbit antibody against GPR-1\/GPR-2. A full-length cDNA clone of gpr-1 (yk103.a4, obtained from Y. Kohara) was used to express full-length or fragments of GPR-1 fused to either 10X Histidine, GST or GSTFlag epitopes in bacteria. Purified denatured full-length His-GPR-1 was used to generate and purify anti-GPR-1 serum. The affinity-purified GPR-1 antiserum showed a distinct staining pattern that was eliminated by gpr-1\/gpr-2 RNAi."
Antibody
Antibody_info	"WBAntibody00000263"
Antibody_info	"WBAntibody00000624"
GO_term	"GO:0000776"
