Subcellular_localization	"When this construct was expressed under the unc-115 promoter, it fully rescued the movement and motor axon guidance defects in unc-71 mutants. UNC-71::GFP was excluded from cell bodies, and was detected in the areas near the nerve ring and along the nerve cords. This UNC-71::GFP was also expressed in hypodermis using the Pe15*2 promoter, and found that GFP was associated to areas near the nerve cord. Thus, UNC-71 is likely associated with cell membranes."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00028087"

