Pattern	"JAC-1GFP is present at epidermal cell borders throughout morphogenesis. JAC-1GFP is present at the borders of intercalating cells in the dorsal epidermis. During ventral enclosure, JAC-1GFP concentrates at the lateral edges of cells near the leading edge and is observed at sites of cellcell contact at the ventral midline. JAC-1-GFP continues to localize to epidermal cell borders during elongation."
Reference	"WBPaper00005972"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00002175"
Reporter_gene
