Antibody	"Polyclonal rabbit and rat antibody. PCR was used to amplify a 1.2 kb fragment of yk167g6, encoding the C-terminal 425 aa of KLP-18 (PARMA....TTKP): forward: 5-GAGGATCCCCTGCACGAATGGCTTTGTT-3, reverse: 5-ATGCGGTACCTGGCTTTGTGGTCTGACT-3. The fragment was cloned in frame into the 6xHis-tag expression vector pQE-30 (Qiagen), transformed, and induced in E. coli strain M15[pREP4] (Qiagen). Recombinant protein was purified on Ni-NTA matrix (Qiagen) and sent to Eurogentec for immunization. Final bleeds of one rabbit and one rat were purified using the 6xHis-KLP-18 fragment conjugated to AminoLink Plus (Pierce)."
Antibody
Antibody_info	"WBAntibody00000693"
Antibody_info	"WBAntibody00000694"
