Pattern	"xbaIp:bam-2::gfp promoter activity was detected primarily on the surface of a subset of neurons in the head, tail, and ventral nerve cord and on the VulF vulval cell. Neuronal expression was observed and maintained from late embryonic through adult stages, and VulF expression was observed continuously beginning at about mid-L4. Using different reporter constructs, bam-2 promoter activity was also observed in the somatic gonad but not in VC neurons."
