Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00006845"
Remark	"Although this expression is strikingly similar to the coelomocyte expression of the sea urchin OLF protein amassin, authors rule out the possibility that unc-122 acts in coelomocytes to control locomotory behavior."
