Pattern	"TRR-1 was present in weakly detectable levels in somatic nuclei of larvae and adults. Among the nuclei expressing TRR-1 were those of P(3N-8).p. TRR-1 was readily detectable in germ nuclei of larvae and adults."
Reference	"WBPaper00013412"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00007028"
Subcellular_localization	"In whole-mount stainings of wild-type animals, TRR-1 was detected in the nuclei of one-cell and subsequent stage embryos. During the pachytene and diakinesis stages of meiosis I, as observed in syncytial germ nuclei and cellularized oocytes, respectively, TRR-1 was localized to condensed chromosomes. However, TRR-1 was not specifically localized to condensed mitotic chromosomes of early-stage embryos."

Expr_pattern : "Expr2922"
Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0005175"
Antibody
