Pattern	"During the late-L3 stage very little AJM-1 was detected, and what was present was not yet concentrated at apical junctions. Only in mid-L4 did AJM-1 begin to accumulate apically, starting in the proximal gonad and moving more distally. The appearance of AJM-1 at apical junctions roughly correlated with the disappearance of PAR-3."
