Pattern	"The Pe15*2::GFP reporter is expressed in the major hypodermis, persisting throughout larval development and into the adult stage. Pe15*2::GFP was not seen in the lateral hypodermal blast cells (the seam cells). An identical expression pattern was observed using the Pe15*2::lacZ reporter."
Reference	"WBPaper00024207"
Remark	"Expression of the e15 enhancer."
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00028258"

Expr_pattern : "Expr2945"
Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0003675" Partial
Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0005733" Partial
Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0005733" Remark "Expressed in dorsal hypodermal cells and seam cells, not expressed in ventral hypodermal cells."
Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0006000" Certain
Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0006370" Certain
