Pattern	"The iri-1::gfp is expressed in the terminal bulb of the pharynx, amphid socket cells, pharyngeal-intestinal valve, intestine, excretory cell, rectal epithelial cells, and vulva hypodermis. In addition, iri-1::gfp is expressed in the corpus of the pharynx, the pharyngeal neuron I3, the anal sphincter and in the gonad precursor cells Z1 and Z4."
Reference	"WBPaper00024213"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00002148"
