Pattern	"HLH-2 does not accumulate detectably in any cell of the gonad until Z1 and Z4 have undergone two rounds of division, near the end of the L1 stage. HLH-2 was consistently observed in the DTCs (Z1.aa and Z4.pp) and in the presumptive AC and mature AC. HLH-2 was also weakly and inconsistently present in Z1.pp and Z4.aa (the parents of Z1.ppp and Z4.aaa), as well as their sisters, Z1.pa and Z4.ap."
Reference	"WBPaper00024330"
