Remark	"The constructs pPD95.77CeODC(2047), pPD95.77CeAdoMet(3720) and pPD95.77CeSPDS(1687) were generated using the same sense primers as above but the anti sense primers 5'-GGA TCC AAT GTC ACG GCA CAT TTG GAG-3' (ODC-AS1), 5'-CCC GGG AAA GTT GGT GGC AGA CGT GGC-39 (AdoMet-AS1) GGA TCC GTT CAT GGC TTT TCG GAG (SPDS-AS1), respectively, that are located within the first 50 bp of the open reading frames. The constructs pPD95.77CeSPDS(1687), pPD95.77CeAdoMet(3720) and pPD95.77CeODC(2047) exhibited the same expression pattern as pPD95.77CeSPDS-1, pPD95.77CeAdoMet-1 or pPD95.77CeODC-1, indicating that the regions downstream of the translational start site do not contain promoter elements that affect the expression pattern of the three genes."
