Subcellular_localization	"Staining of transgenic embryos with GFP antibodies confirmed the centriolar enrichment, as well as the cytoplasmic distribution. As expected, GFPSAS-6 colocalizes with the centriolar component SAS-4. Quantification of fluorescence intensity in such recordings established that levels of centriolar GFPSAS-6 remain constant throughout the cell cycle."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00000664"

