Life_stage	"WBls:0000032"
Pattern	"RT-PCR experiments on RNA prepared from late embryos, predauer larvae and adults confirmed previous results (see Expr86) and showed that cut-1 is expressed only during dauer formation but not in late embryogenesis and in adults."
RT_PCR
