Pattern	"The smp-1::egfp expression was detected in all vulval precursor cells and their descendants. In addition to the vulva, smp-1::egfp was detected in larval seam cells, the epidermal cells of a larval male tail, and some neurons in the ventral cord and around the nerve rings. The ventral and dorsal cords also expressed GFP. hyp7 did not appear to express the transgene. The expression pattern resembled that of plx-1::egfp."
