Gene	"WBGene00002173"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000003"
Pattern	"Expressed in the embryonic epidermis during the process of ventral enclosure."
Reference	"WBPaper00024544"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00002173"
Subcellular_localization	"ITR-1 is expressed at significant levels in the embryonic epidermis during the process of ventral enclosure. The reticular pattern of staining within these cells suggests that ITR-1 is localized to the ER and close to the plasma membrane. Consistent with Western blot analysis, ITR-1 is also present in jc5 embryos derived from mothers grown at 15N0C, although the overall membrane staining is reduced and more signal is present in the cytoplasm."

Expr_pattern : "Expr3392"
Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0005451" Certain
Anatomy_term	"WBbt:0005813" Certain
Gene	"WBGene00014027"
Pattern	"In tpk-1 mutants that carry a [myo-3::tpk-1::gfp] or [myo-2::tpk-1::gfp] transgenic array, GFP fluorescence is detected as expected in the body-wall muscles or the pharyngeal muscles, respectively. However, in both cases the construct profoundly rescued all tested mutant phenotypes."
Reference	"WBPaper00024553"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00014027"
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00028593"

Expr_pattern : "Expr3393"
Antibody
