Pattern	"These experiments showed coexpression of the C1 and the MH4 antigens in the dorsal and ventral hypodermis of the bean, 1.5-fold and 3-fold embryos, in the larvae and in adults. However, in contrast to the MH4 staining pattern no visible C1 expression was seen in the pharynx and also the intensity of C1 staining in the larval and adult hypodermis was significantly weaker. C1 expression was detected weakly in the intestinal terminal web of the embryos and strongly in the same structure of all larval developmental stages and of the adults."
