Gene	"WBGene00003918"
Reference	"WBPaper00024378"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00003918"
Remark	"No GO_term assigned."
Subcellular_localization	"A tight spatial correlation between NMY-2 and a second anterior PAR protein, PAR-3, was observed in fixed embryos between meiosis II and pseudocleavage; the NMY-2 cap extended slightly posterior to the PAR-3 cap consistent with the de novo formation of NMY-2::GFP foci at the posterior."

