Pattern	"ref-1(1.8kb)::ref-1::gfp expression first appeared in the left, Notch-activated E4 cells and persisted only in their daughters, the left E8 cells. Expression disappeared late in the E8 stage, but reappeared during the next cell cycle on the right side of the E16 primoridium."
Reference	"WBPaper00025235"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00004334"
Remark	"A ref-1(2.0kb)::gfp transcriptional reporter showed the identical expression pattern as the ref-11.8kb::ref-1::gfp transgene"
Remark	"Picture: Figure 2A, 2B, 2C."
Reporter_gene
