GO_term	"GO:0030424"
GO_term	"GO:0043025"
Gene	"WBGene00006562"
Pattern	"TDC-1 was coexpressed with TBH-1 in the RICs and gonadal sheath cells. TDC-1 staining also was present in the gonadal sheath cells and appeared to be localized to the projections of these cells between the oocytes. Bright staining of a pair of neurons was observed in the lateral ganglion. These cells were identified as the RIM motor neurons. Four uterine cells, which we identified as the UV1 cells, also expressed TDC-1. Expression in the uterine cells was not observed until the late L4 stage, the time at which the UV1 cells are generated. The octopaminergic RIC neurons expressed TDC-1 at much lower levels than do the tyraminergic RIM neurons."
Reference	"WBPaper00025096"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00006562"
Subcellular_localization	"TDC-1 staining was observed in the cell bodies and axonal processes of TDC-1-expressing neurons."

