Pattern	"COGC-3 was detected in most tissues, including muscle, intestine and hypodermis. COGC-3 expression in the germline was very low, or nil. In whole-mount staining, COGC-3 was strongly expressed in cells of the pharynx, vulva and seam hypodermis, and of the intestine."
