Pattern	"Consistent with a previous report, expression of PFN-1 was detected from early embryonic stages. During the late embryonic stage and in the L1 larva, PFN-1 was found in the nerve ring. PFN-1 also expressed in adult worms. Immunostaining of adult worms with anti-PFN-1 antibody showed diffuse staining throughout the body."
