Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00003989"
Remark	"The patterns of expression and localization of PFN-1 in the pfn-2 and of PFN-1 in the pfn-3 null mutants were indistinguishable from those in wild type."
Subcellular_localization	"At the 2-cell stage embryo, PFN-1 showed diffuse staining in the cytoplasm and localized to cell-cell contacts where it colocalized with actin."

