Pattern	"A transcriptional GFP fusion gene kat-1p::GFP, which included 1.5 kb of the kat-1 5' regulatory region, was expressed in the intestine from late embryogenesis throughout the life cycle and in the body wall muscle and pharynx from larval stage 2 (L2) to adulthood."
