Gene	"WBGene00002183"
Reference	"WBPaper00027085"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00002183"
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"The subcellular localization of full-length KAT-1 was examined by inserting a FLAG epitope tag within its internal loop domain. This epitope-tagged KAT-1 (KAT-1_FLAG) was functional, as it rescued the lipid accumulation phenotype of kat-1 tub-1 mutant animals when expressed under the endogenous kat-1 promoter. KAT-1_FLAG localized to the mitochondria of intestine and body wall muscle. In addition, KAT-1 possesses a functional peroxisomal targeting signal (PTS1), although full-length KAT-1 have not been detected in peroxisomes."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00028967"

