Remark	"Starting in mid-larval stages through to the adult was suspiciously reminiscent of the expression of the co-transformation marker, rol-6. It is generally accepted that rol-6 enhancers, present on the mixed extrachromosomal arrays formed upon microinjection transformation of C.elegans, can act on reporter gene fusions in the same array."
