Pattern	"PAR-6GFP was expressed in epidermal, pharyngeal, intestinal, and excretory epithelial cells, colocalized with PAR-6(immunostaining) at apical surfaces, and was present even when the transgene was introduced at fertilization. In summary, PAR-6 localizes to the apical cortex of most or all embryonic epithelial cells and at least some PAR-6 in epithelial cells arises from zygotic par-6 expression."
