Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"GFP-tagged LON-2-protein fluorescence is weak and localizes to the surface of intestinal cells, most visibly to the most posterior cells. This observation is consistent with a GPI modification of LON-2 because GPI moieties link their proteins to the extracellular surface of cell membranes."
