Remark	"In addition to its widespread neuronal expression, EFN-4::GFP is also expressed in anterior and posterior epidermal cells, including the lateral epidermal cells H0 and QV5, the leading ventral epidermal cells of the anterior, and the posterior three pairs of ventral epidermal cells (P7 - 12)."
