Subcellular_localization	"Tagged NSY-5::GFP and NSY-5::DsRed fusion proteins that rescued nsy-5 mutants were first detected in embryos in a punctate pattern surrounding the sensory neurons and interneurons that expressed nsy-5::GFP. Individual NSY-5 puncta appeared to reside at the borders between neuronal cell bodies and were largely excluded from axons and dendrites."
