Subcellular_localization	"The subcellular localization of NSY-5 was examined in COS cells expressing a heterologous NSY-5::EGFP fusion protein. In isolated COS cells, NSY-5::EGFP was observed mainly in intracellular vesicles. In pairs of COS cells that contacted each other, NSY-5::EGFP clustered at points of cell-cell contact, but only when both cells expressed NSY-5."

