Pattern	"Expressed weakly in intestinal precursor, E.p, at 26-cell stage embryo at the beginning of gastrulation. Expressed in E.p and AB.xxxp daughters and in D.a and D.p. See Expression pattern 512 for expression later in development."
Reference	"WBPaper00002941"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00000437"
Remark	"In situ hybridization showed that ceh-13 mRNA was not present at early embryonic stages. It appeared first in E.p and then in the AB.xxxp cells, only a short time before CEH-13. Transgenic Marker: rol-6(su1006). Subcellular localization: : Nuclear in E.p, cytoplasmic in AB.xxxp. Nuclear in E.p and Ab.xxxp daughters."
