Pattern	"E.p and daughters during gastrulation, then fades during morphogenesis. No staining seen in larval or adult intestine; AB.xxxp and their daughters during gastrulation; D.a and D.p during gastrulation; unidentified anterior embryonic cells, other cells in AB, MS and D lineages throughout embryogenesis. Strongly expressed in H2L, H2R, V1L, V1R at comma stage embryo. Also seen in anterior dorsal hypodermal cells and anterior body wall muscle cells at comma stage Embryo. Ventral nerve cord, lateral hypodermal and dorsal hypodermal cells show strong expression at L1. H2L and H2R show weak expression at L1. V1.pxx cells do not show expression at L1, but all V1 through V4 descendants show expression at L2. Expressed in male tail at unspecified stage."
Reference	"WBPaper00003508"
