Antibody
Antibody_info	"WBAntibody00000090"
Antibody_info	"WBAntibody00001538"
Antibody_info	"WBAntibody00001539"
GO_term	"GO:0005737"
GO_term	"GO:0016020"
Gene	"WBGene00001609"
In_Situ
In_situ	"antisense probe to glp-1"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000005"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000007"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000008"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000010"
Pattern	"Faint expression in AB at 2-cell stage, becoming stronger in AB descendants after 4-cell stage. Signal weakens, between the 8- and 28-cell stages. GLP-1 not detected again until after the 100-cell stage in unidentified cells."
Reference	"WBPaper00001941"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00001609"
Remark	"Subcellular localization: GLP-1 was found in the cytoplasm at the 2-cell stage, then in cytoplasm and membranes at 4-cell and 8-cell stages. Cytoplasmic GLP-1 fades after the 8-cell stage, and disappears by the 28-cell stage. Membrane-associated GLP-1 is faint by the 28-cell stage. The glp-1 mRNA was distributed uniformly through the 8-cell stage. Levels of glp-1 mRNA decline after the 8-cell stage and largely disappear by the 28-cell stage, though signal consistently persisted later in posterior parts of embryos. mRNA reappears after 100-cell stage, paralleling immunostaining results."
Remark	"early embryo(author) = blastula + gastrulating embryo(curator)."
Strain	"WBStrain00000001"
Subcellular_localization	"GLP-1 was found in the cytoplasm at the 2-cell stage, then in cytoplasm and membranes at 4-cell and 8-cell stages. Cytoplasmic GLP-1 fades after the 8-cell stage, and disappears by the 28-cell stage. Membrane-associated GLP-1 is faint by the 28-cell stage. The glp-1 mRNA was distributed uniformly through the 8-cell stage. Levels of glp-1 mRNA decline after the 8-cell stage and largely disappear by the 28-cell stage, though signal consistently persisted later in posterior parts of embryos. mRNA reappears after 100-cell stage, paralleling immunostaining results."

