Antibody_info	"WBAntibody00000129"
Antibody_info	"WBAntibody00001590"
GO_term	"GO:0005938"
Gene	"WBGene00003917"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000005"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000010"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000041"
Pattern	"PAR-1 is found in the cortex of germ line cells in the whole adult gonad. In early embryos, cortical PAR-2 expression continues in P0, P1, P2, P3 and P4 (the cells of germline lineage), fades in Z2 and Z3. In all but P4, PAR-1 exhibits an asymmetric distribution."
Reference	"WBPaper00002581"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00003917"
Remark	"Antibodies against the amino and carboxy termini gave the same results."
Remark	"early embryo(author) = blastula + gastrulating embryo(curator)."
Strain	"WBStrain00000001"
Subcellular_localization	"In the distal gonad, PAR-2 staining is strongest at septa between nuclei. In the proximal gonad, PAR-2 is found uniformly in the periphery. PAR-2 is associated with the cortical cytoskeleton. PAR-2 becomes localized to the posterior cortex in P0 through P3. During the symmetrical division of P4, PAR-2 is uniformly distributed at the cortex so that both Z2 and Z3 initially show PAR-2."

