Northern
Pattern	"This gene transcribes into 1.7 and 0.9 kb mRNA bands, 1.7 kb band being more abundant. 0.9 kb mRNA is detected only in embryo and L1 stages (after 3 days exposure). 1.7 kb mRNA is detected at all developmental stages but the level of expression is highest in embryos and decreased dramatically during development being minimal (10% of embryonic level) in adults. There was a 12% increase at the L3 stage compared with L2."
