Pattern	"In L1: mRNA localized to cytosol of many cells indicating syncytial hypodermis. Other larval stages - adult: weaker staining of the hypodermis. Expression also observed in epithelial cells in the anus, deirids, buccal cavity and vulva. Also localized in the pharynx. Adm-1 mRNA is present throughout post embryonic development in the syncytial hypodermis, hypodermal-derived tissues, pharynx and in other cells."
