Antibody	"Expression vector pRSETA was used to express CeTwist protein in E.coli BL21 (lys-S) cells as a His-tagged fusion protein. CeTwist-His protein was purified with Ni affinity column in denaturing conditions. Polyclonal antibody was produced in mice."
Antibody
Antibody_info	"WBAntibody00000188"
Gene	"WBGene00001953"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000003"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000024"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000027"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000035"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000038"
Life_stage	"WBls:0000041"
Pattern	"Immuno fluorescence staining with antisera to ceTwist indicated similar expression pattern to reporter fusion. CeTwist first detected in L1 in defecation-associated muscles and in small number of neuron-like cells in the head. In later larvae, CeTwist was detected in SMs and their descendants. Expression in M and its descendants prior to to the SM stage was detected with reporter fusion but not with antibody. Expression in mature coelomocytes was also only detected with reporter fusions."
Reference	"WBPaper00003174"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00001953"
Remark	"CeTwist means hlh-8 here. See Expr607 for the pattern of the same locus."
Remark	"This information was extracted from published material (Archana Sharma-Oates, Andrew Mounsey and Ian A. Hope)."

