Pattern	"Post-embryonic expression. L2-L4-- punctate signal in 6 cells in the body (coelomocytes), 2 ventral at level of Int3, 2 ventral anterior to developing gonad, 2 left and right subdorsal posterior to gonad. Weaker signal in muscle. Head-- 6 cells closely apposed to pharynx at the level of the nerve ring, 2 subdorsal, 4 ventral-subventral; single cell dorsal to second bulb of the pharynx. Pharynx-- g1 gland cell."
Reference	"WBPaper00002319"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00010314"
