Pattern	"pPCubi3 Expression is observed in the intestine, nerve ring body muscle, hypodermis, pharynx, pharyngeal-intestinal valve, vulva and weak expression in the ventral nerve cord. No expression is seen in embryos. ppCubi6 Expression is observed at a higher level than pPCUbi3 animals. With additional expression seen in all somatic cells of gonad, including distal tip cells, sheath cells and cells of spermatheca and uterus. Also expression is seen throughout the embryos."
Reference	"WBPaper00002284"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00006728"
Remark	"This information was extracted from published material (Archana Sharma-Oates, Andrew Mounsey and Ian A. Hope)."
Remark	"pPCUbi6 containing animals show various degrees of gonad abnormality and produce few progeny."
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00029713"

