Remark	"Picture: Figure 2."
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"The GFP-ALX-1 fusion protein appeared punctate in most tissues. In the intestine, GFP-ALX-1 was enriched near the apical plasma membrane (PM) and was also clearly enriched on distinct cytoplasmic puncta."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00001780"

