Gene	"WBGene00004027"
Reference	"WBPaper00031439"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00004027"
Remark	"Picture: Figure 5."
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"Wild-type PIE-1 accumulates in numerous fine nuclear foci."
