Subcellular_localization	"Immunostaining of wild-type embryos revealed that gp210 was enriched at NEBD and in the remnants of the NE that surround the mitotic spindle late during metaphase in the absence of nucleoporins recognized by mAb414 or antibodies against NUP153."

