Pattern	"LIP-1::GFP expression was observed in most somatic cells starting during embryogenesis and persisting throughout larval development and adulthood. LIP-1::GFP was uniformly expressed at a low level in all VPCs until the L2 stage. In early L3, LIP-1::GFP expression was up-regulated in the secondary VPCs P5.p and P7.p in 71% of [lip-1::nls::gfp] animals. At later stages, LIP-1::GFP expression remained high in the descendants of P5.p and P7.p and low in the descendants of P6.p. LIP-1::GFP was also strongly expressed in hyp7."
