Remark	"Consistent with this localization pattern, and similar to Drosophila OSEG4, a GFP-tagged version of the human IFTA-1 homologue (ENSP00000314444) localizes at the centrosomal\/basal body region of a mouse IMCD3 ciliated cell line. The localization of human IFTA-1 is essentially the same as many other known basal body\/ciliary proteins, including BBS proteins."
