Pattern	"The expression of the internal promoter::gfp-LacZ reporter was first detected at the comma stage. In addition the internal promoter (see Expr8385) drives expression in the intestinal cells, with GFP expression being detected in both the anterior and posterior intestine cells where it persisted through adulthood."
Reference	"WBPaper00032356"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00013095"
Remark	"Picture: Figure 2F,G."
Reporter_gene
