Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00004244"
Remark	"Picture: Fig. 1."
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"Many of the P granule-positive foci also contain PUF-8::GFP, indicating that PUF-8 is indeed localized on P granules."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00005857"
Transgene	"WBTransgene00005858"

