Pattern	"GFP fluorescence was detected in 20 neurons. In the head, DKF-2BGFP accumulated in amphid sensory neurons (ASE, AFD, ASG, AWC, and AWA), integrative interneurons (AIM, RIC, AIY, AVF, AVJ, AVK, ADA, and RMG), neurons involved in social feeding and O2 sensing (AUA, URX, PQR, AQR, and BAG), and the neurosecretory motor neuron NSM. DKF-2BGFP also accumulated in PVQ, PVR, and PVW interneurons in the tail. DKF-2BGFP was observed in late embryos, L1 to L4 larvae, and adult animals."
