Subcellular_localization	"lev-9::T7 animals display a similar sensitivity to levamisole as wild-type animals. Immunofluorescence staining using anti-T7 antibodies specifically detected T7LEV-9 as puncta distributed along the ventral and dorsal nerve cords and in the nerve ring where head muscles are innervated. These puncta were juxtaposed to cholinergic varicosities and co-localized with L-AChR clusters."
