Reference	"WBPaper00035888"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00014234"
Remark	"Picture: Fig. S8A."
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"The VPS-29::GFP translational fusion protein driven by the vps-29 promoter (Pvps-29vps-29::gfp) was enriched around germ cell corpses, overlapping with SNX-1::mCherry, indicating that VPS-29 is also recruited to the surface of cell corpses in the process of cell corpse removal."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00030787"

