Gene	"WBGene00006957"
Reference	"WBPaper00036309"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00006957"
Remark	"Picture: Fig 4."
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"GFP expression was observed diffused in the nerve cords but was also enriched in discrete punctate structures along the ventral nerve cord. WSP-1 localized to regions immediately adjacent to RAB-3 puncta. This region of WSP-1 localization corresponds to periactive zone localization, which is F-actin rich region that regulates synaptic growth and plasticity. Therefore, WSP-1::GFP fusion protein localizes to the pre-synaptic region of the neuromuscular junction."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00008700"

