Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00018827"
Remark	"No GFP signal was observed in worms carrying Ppst-2b::egfp (translational fusion, forward primer 5- TTGACTCCTTTATTTGCCTGAAA 3, reverse primer 5- CATTGTTGCTACTGTGAAAAAGG 3). This suggested that the pst-2b promoter does not have inherent activity."
Remark	"Picture: Fig 6E, 6F."
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00030881"

