Remark	"To test if EGRH-1 antibody staining was specific, authors stained egrh-1(tm1736) mutants, which are predicted to encode a truncated protein that would be recognized by our antibody, and egrh-1(tm1736) with egrh-1 expression further reduced by RNAi. Staining was decreased in both cases, indicating that this antibody stain is specific for EGRH-1."
