Pattern	"Expression of HID-1::GFP was observed predominantly in the nervous system, the intestine, the pharynx, and in uv1 secretory cells (data not shown). In the nervous system, HID-1-GFP was primarily localized in the synapse-rich nerve ring, ventral cord, and dorsal cord process bundles. In the nerve cords HID-1-GFP was punctate in distribution. GFP fluorescence was detected in neuronal cell bodies as well. HID-1-GFP under the hid-1 promoter was capable of rescuing the uncoordinated movement, aldicarb resistance, the egg laying, and the defecation defects of hid-1(sa722) null mutants."
Reference	"WBPaper00037804"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00001844"
