Pattern	"Although low levels of reporter expression were observed ubiquitously, a subset of organs showed higher expression of MISC- 1::GFP. GFP expression began early in embryogenesis in the intestinal precursor cells. The protein exhibited intestinal and neuronal localization in newly hatched L1s while it was mainly present in the anterior pharynx in adults."
