Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00015186"
Reporter_gene
Subcellular_localization	"C. elegans embryonic and larval cells exhibited a typical mitochondrial pattern for the localization of MISC-1::GFP. Co-localization of MISC-1::GFP and the mitochodria-specific marker MitoTracker Red CMXRos in muscle and seam cells indicates that MISC-1 is a mitochondrial protein."
Transgene	"WBTransgene00031028"

