Pattern	"dhs-21::gfp fluorescence was especially prominent in the intestine, utse, gonadal sheath cells and sp-ut valve. First, diffused GFP fluorescence was detected as early as two-fold embryos, and the expression in intestine was observed at L1 through L3 stage. Then, the utse, gonadal sheath cells and sp-ut valve expression became obvious at L4. The spatial expression of intestine, utse and gonad continues up to 5-7 days. Male adults displayed a similar expression pattern, except for the utse, which is absent in males."
