Reference	"WBPaper00024623"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00004726"
Subcellular_localization	"SAS-6 colocalized with SAS-4 to small focal structures in the center of the centrosome throughout the embryonic cell cycle. SAS-6 also colocalized with SAS-4 in sperm. Immuno-EM on embryos from wild-type hermaphrodites prepared by high-pressure freezing\/freeze substitution confirmed the result. In sections containing centrioles, gold particles were observed associated with the centriolar cylinders. Immuno-EM for SAS-5 indicates that it too localizes to the centriolar cylinders. The combination of light microscopy and EM analysis indicates that SAS-6, like SAS-4 and SAS-5, is a bona fide centriolar protein."

