Reference	"WBPaper00040348"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00004043"
Subcellular_localization	"Antibodies that specifically recognize PLK-2 revealed a dynamic localization pattern in the germline. Premeiotic nuclei undergoing mitosis showed faint staining at centrosomes and kinetochores. By contrast, transition zone nuclei showed strong patches of PLK-2 staining at the nuclear envelope that colocalized with all four pairing centers ZnF proteins and the associated patches of SUN-1 and ZYG-12. By mid to late pachytene PLK-2 staining was no longer detected at pairing centers, but appeared along the synaptonemal complexes and disassembled with synaptonemal complex central region components at diplotene."

