Life_stage	"WBls:0000041"
Pattern	"In worms carrying the Ptry-5::TRY-5::GFP reporter, the TRY-5::GFP fusion protein exhibited a localization pattern consistent with secretion from the vas deferens. Within the valve and cuboidal cells, TRY-5::GFP was localized to globular foci. In L4 larvae, most globules aligned with the apical domain that lines the developing sperm channel. In mature adults, very large globules were present that tended to cluster apically, and additional small globules were present throughout the cytoplasm. We sometimes observed TRY-5::GFP within the lumen of the seminal vesicle, likely as a result of release from the adjacent, highly-expressing valve cells."
Reference	"WBPaper00040451"
Reflects_endogenous_expression_of	"WBGene00006623"
Reporter_gene
Transgene	"WBTransgene00009909"

