Pattern	"In transgenic animals, dcar-1::GFP was expressed in some sensory neurons and in some non-neuronal cells. In sensory neurons, dcar-1::GFP was expressed in several amphid chemosensory neurons including the ASH neurons. dcar-1::GFP was also expressed in the ASI sensory neurons, the uv1 neuroendocrine cells, the uterine toroid cells, and the PVQ interneurons."
