Pattern	"In worms expressing cbs-1::GFP, the GFP signal was observed in the hypodermis, intestine, body wall muscle cells and pharyngeal muscles pm3, pm4, pm5, pm6, pm7, and pm8 in all larval stages as well as in adults. We did not observe a GFP signal in embryos, although previous transcriptional screens and peptide mapping studies have reported expression of cbs-1 in this developmental stage."
